# Spike S4 local ignores — generated output + Rust build artifacts.
#
# Generated result files (report.json / summary.md / per-run time captures) are
# intentionally NOT committed: they are host/time-specific evidence, never source
# of truth. `Cargo.lock` IS committed (reproducible standalone build). We do NOT
# ignore Nix caches here and never touch `/nix` from this spike.

/out/
/.time-*.txt
/.time.txt

# Rust build artifacts (mirrors the repo-root .gitignore intent for `target`).
/target/
**/target/
